#. Description of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "Philosophy is a modern masonry blog WordPress theme. Its stylish design and beautiful typography make it an ideal template for a personal blog or a publication. It ships styles for the standard, video and audio post formats, a featured area on the blog home page, seven footer widget areas and About and Contact page templates. Philosophy is fully responsive, retina ready and translation ready, and it is built without jQuery."
